WEBVTT

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:03.596
I am now living with HIV.

00:03:04.764 --> 00:03:07.016
It took me a long while
to process it at first,

00:03:07.058 --> 00:03:11.395
because I'd gone from a man who had won
every trophy that he had ever dreamt of

00:03:11.437 --> 00:03:13.773
to someone who,
all of a sudden, was living a lie,

00:03:13.773 --> 00:03:17.568
who was ashamed, embarrassed, isolated,

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.237
afraid I was going to die,

00:03:19.237 --> 00:03:20.655
afraid to tell anyone,

00:03:20.696 --> 00:03:22.156
afraid to tell my family,

00:03:22.156 --> 00:03:24.951
afraid I was going to lose
everything and everyone

00:03:24.951 --> 00:03:28.246
that I'd worked so hard for
and I loved so much.

00:03:28.246 --> 00:03:32.250
I was afraid that from now on,
I would be defined by a virus.